                <pb facs="0582" n="488" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg488"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. McDonald to Mr.
                            Olney.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Teheran</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-05-01"><hi rendition="#italic">May 1,
                        1896</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Prime minister and royal princess express profound gratitude for President’s
                    message of abhorrence and condolence in name of American people and are deeply
                    touched at manifestation of sympathy; Crown Prince proclaimed last night at
                    Tabriz; quiet continues.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">McDonald.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
